# issue: none
# notes: `search` is not a registry row: the type checker refuses it with `T6` and the fix `match_terms($d.title, terms("graph", mode: any))`, an edit over the call that keeps its any-term membership; nothing executes.

--- runner
timeout_ms: 10000
environments:
  - target: omnigraph-engine
    storage: local-filesystem

--- schema
node Doc {
    slug: String @key
    title: String @index(fulltext)
}

--- seed
{"type":"Doc","data":{"slug":"a","title":"Graph engines"}}

--- query
query q() { match { $d: Doc } where search($d.title, "graph") return { $d.slug } }

--- expect error: type error: T6: `search` is not a registry row; the lexical predicate is `match_terms
